Source: rawstor
Section: python
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vasily Stepanov <vasily.stepanov@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 12),
               dh-python,
               python3-all-dev,
               python3-setuptools
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: python3-rawstor
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         librawstor (>= @PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR@.@PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR@.0),
         librawstor (<< @PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR@.@PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR_NEXT@.0)
Description: Rawstor python bindings
Homepage: https://github.com/rawstor/librawstor
